{"title": "Gregarious Caster", "pageid": 28281, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Gregarious_Caster", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Gregarious Caster</b> is a passive feature that increases your cantrip damage significantly.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Your <a href=\"/wiki/Cantrip\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cantrip\">cantrips</a> deal additional damage equal to your <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> Modifier. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potent_Robe\" title=\"Potent Robe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4c/Potent_Robe_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Potent_Robe\" title=\"Potent Robe\">Potent Robe</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li><b>Gregarious Caster</b> stacks with similar effects such as the <a href=\"/wiki/Draconic_Bloodline\" title=\"Draconic Bloodline\">Draconic Bloodline</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a>'s <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Affinity:_Damage\" title=\"Elemental Affinity: Damage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp/20px-Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp/30px-Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp/40px-Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elemental Affinity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp/20px-Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/Elemental_Affinity_Damage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Affinity:_Damage\" title=\"Elemental Affinity: Damage\">Elemental Affinity</a> feature and the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necklace_of_Elemental_Augmentation\" title=\"Necklace of Elemental Augmentation\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Amulet_Necklace_F_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Necklace_of_Elemental_Augmentation\" title=\"Necklace of Elemental Augmentation\">Necklace of Elemental Augmentation</a>, leading to the ability modifier potentially being added to the damage of certain spells several times. It also stacks with Warlock's <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Agonising_Blast\" title=\"Agonising Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp/30px-Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp/40px-Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Agonising Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Agonising_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Agonising_Blast\" title=\"Agonising Blast\">Agonising Blast</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200505\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1679/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 14915/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5738/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nEx